cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se usar estes roteiros, cite o artigo e este repositório."
title: "dirac-to-21cm"
abstract: >-
  Scripts that reproduce the numerical results and the HI4PI 21 cm
  figure of the article "From the Dirac equation to the 21 cm line".
  Spectral axis in the radio convention; N_HI = C ∫ T_B dv.
type: software
url: "https://github.com/tssduarte/dirac-to-21cm"
